.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-open 1 "" "Sway Things 0.1.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-open \- Start the app, or bring its window up if it runs, at a page or a setting
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things open\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fILINK\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the app, or bring its window up if it runs, at a page or a setting
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fILINK\fR]
A page, e.g. `keyboard`, or a setting, e.g. `input.keyboard.repeat_rate`
